  "depth_scope": {
    "ja": "反応拡散：空間2次と時間4次を分けて測る: 線形の拡散・反応演算子を、連続と半離散のFourier厳密解を用いて小規模に検証します。 Turing不安定性：線形成長率と小振幅パターン: Schnakenberg型反応拡散で、一様平衡の安定性と拡散による選択モードの成長を行列指数で検証します。",
    "en": "Reaction-diffusion: separate second-order space and fourth-order time: Validate a small linear diffusion-reaction operator against continuous and semidiscrete Fourier solutions. Turing instability: linear growth and small-amplitude patterns: Use a matrix exponential to validate stable homogeneous kinetics and diffusion-driven growth of a selected Schnakenberg mode."
